{
  "uid": "mempool-integrity",
  "title": "Integrity",
  "description": "The fixed data-integrity bugs, split by what a number means. Fix failed: symptoms that must stay at zero, and what the Grafana alerts in docker/grafana/provisioning/alerting watch. Fix at work: how often a fix had to step in, which is the fix working, not failing. Context: neither, but needed to read the other two.",
